msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Inföhren"

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:98
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "&dolphin; is a file manager for &kde; which aims to improve usability at the user interface level. &dolphin; is not intended to be a competitor to &konqueror;. &dolphin; focuses only on being a file manager whereas &konqueror; is a universal viewer of many file types. This development approach allows for concentrating on optimizing the user interface for the specific task of file management."
msgid "&dolphin; is &kde;'s default file manager. It aims to improve usability at the user interface level. &dolphin; focuses only on being a file manager whereas &konqueror;, which was &kde;'s default file manager in &kde; 3 and can still be used for file management, is a universal viewer for many file types."
msgstr "&dolphin; is en Dateipleger för &kde;, de de Bruukborkeit över de Böversiet verbetern will. &dolphin; schall keen Konkurangs to &konqueror; wesen. &dolphin; schall bloots en Dateipleger wesen, bides &konqueror; en Universaalkieker för vele Dateitypen is. Dit Vörgahn bi't Utwickeln maakt dat mööglich, wi maakt toeerst de Böversiet beter för de Opgaven, de bi't Plegen vun Dateien so anfallt."

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid "This development approach allows for concentrating on optimizing the user interface for the specific task of file management."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:110
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Please report any problems or feature requests to the &dolphin; author via the bug report dialog. This is accessible from the <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Report Bug...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu of the application."
msgid "Please report any problems or feature requests to the &dolphin; author via the bug report dialog. This is accessible either from the <guibutton>Configure and control &dolphin;</guibutton> button at the right of the toolbar in the default mode without menu bar; or from <menuchoice><guimenu>Help</guimenu><guimenuitem>Report Bug...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> menu of the application, if the menubar is shown."
msgstr "Maak bitte &dolphin; sien Schriever all Problemen un fehlen Funkschonen över den Fehlerbericht-Dialoog künnig. Den kannst Du över dat Programm sien Menü mit <menuchoice><guimenu>Hülp</guimenu><guimenuitem>Fehler künnig maken...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> opropen."

