#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:515
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editable Mode"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:517
#, no-c-format
msgid "When in bread crumb mode, clicking in the grey area to the right of the path with the &LMB; switches the location bar to the <quote>editable</quote> mode, in which the path can be edited using the keyboard. To switch back to bread crumb mode, click the check mark at the right of the location bar with the &LMB;."
