msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#. +> trunk stable
#: index.docbook:835
#, no-c-format
msgid "The <guilabel>Home Folder</guilabel> is the folder which is opened on startup. The location of the folder can be entered directly or chosen in a dialog which can be opened by clicking the button showing a <quote>folder</quote> icon. Moreover, the current location or the default location (which is the user's home folder) can be used as the Home Folder by clicking the corresponding button."
