msgid "&dolphin; can be configured to open items with a single mouse click (<guilabel>Single-click to open files and folders</guilabel>) or a double mouse click (<guilabel>Double-click to open files and folders</guilabel>). In the latter case, a single mouse click will select the file or folder."
