"<para> The view mode (Icons, Details, Columns) </para>"
"</listitem>"
" "
"<listitem>"
"<para> The sorting of items, which is determined by the sort order (ascending, descending) and the attribute (such as name, size,...) that the items are sorted by </para>"
"</listitem>"
" "
